    "lastBuilt": "2026-05-27",
    "purpose": "Named zones on the property. Each zone carries vertices (fractional 0-1 coords of the base image), a status (draft / confirmed / flagged), and a history log of changes. Observations and plants reference zones via the zoneId field. The browse view is itself a thinking tool — looking at the whole property from above helps Mom form mental models of where things are.",
    "baseImage": "images/property-map/gep-2015-03-leafoff.webp",
    "baseImageFallbackPng": "images/property-map/gep-2015-03-leafoff.png",
    "coordinateSystem": "Fractional (0-1) of the base image. Vertices [x, y] where x = column fraction, y = row fraction.",
    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "schemaNotes": "v1 (2026-05-27): initial. Each zone: id (kebab-case), name (human-readable), type (planted|turf|meadow|forest|water|structure), color (RGB array — decorative; renderer may override), vertices ([[x,y]]), status (draft|confirmed|flagged), createdAt/createdBy/updatedAt/lastEditedBy timestamps, history [{at, by, action, details?}]. The browser draft tool writes the same shape via Worker → GitHub Contents API → zones.json + re-inlined ZONES_DATA, mirroring the Phase F Option C pattern."
  },
